WEBVTT

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:11.416
MARMALADE BOY

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:14.753
But it's still on my mind

00:00:14.753 --> 00:00:16.618
This morning,
more so than before...

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:21.323
A dream was interrupted

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:24.861
I want to know how it ends for...
him and me

00:00:31.203 --> 00:00:36.436
Ah, God, please stop time

00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:40.036
Can't ﬁnd my books...
school uniform...

00:00:40.178 --> 00:00:43.011
My hair won't dry yet

00:00:44.349 --> 00:00:49.810
Ah, help me... my ribbon
doesn't seem to go on right

00:00:50.455 --> 00:00:56.587
All because I dreamt of him

00:00:57.529 --> 00:01:01.295
When I bit into my
half—burnt piece of toast...

00:01:04.036 --> 00:01:08.837
All of a sudden
my heart started pounding

00:01:10.676 --> 00:01:15.545
Sweet and bitter marmalade

00:01:15.681 --> 00:01:18.149
That's why it's on my mind

00:01:18.684 --> 00:01:20.709
Why am I feeling this way?

00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:23.950
Alll want is

00:01:25.457 --> 00:01:28.949
to see his smile

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:53.511
SOMETHING NEW

00:02:39.464 --> 00:02:47.394
I WANT TO FALL IN LOVE —
"HE'S HANDSOME,
BUT I CAN'T FORGIVE HIM!"

00:11:57.021 --> 00:11:59.615
MARMALADE BOY

00:12:05.763 --> 00:12:08.357
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:11.268 --> 00:22:13.065
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:32.556 --> 00:22:35.684
SIDE EFFECTS OF A KISS —
"I DON'T KNOW
WHAT HE'S THINKING."

00:22:54.211 --> 00:22:57.578
The constellations
in the sky up above...

00:22:57.715 --> 00:23:00.343
Shine serenely down at me

00:23:01.952 --> 00:23:05.353
The worried lines
of my face gradually..

00:23:05.522 --> 00:23:08.252
melt into my untouched tea

00:23:08.626 --> 00:23:16.761
It's the moment
I return to myself

00:23:17.468 --> 00:23:22.633
I don't think I'll be getting
any sleep tonight...

00:23:24.041 --> 00:23:27.101
It's all just too sudden...

00:23:27.878 --> 00:23:31.746
How can I deal
with all these new feelings?

00:23:31.882 --> 00:23:35.750
They make me want to laugh,
they make me want to cry...

00:23:36.954 --> 00:23:39.388
It's a strange feeling

00:23:39.523 --> 00:23:47.123
And that all my feelings...
can settle on a single person...

00:23:47.731 --> 00:23:54.466
I want to be holding this feeling

00:23:55.339 --> 00:23:58.866
Until I fall asleep...
